<title>USA: Ford May US car sales fall, truck sales rise.</title>
<headline>Ford May US car sales fall, truck sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co</p>
<p>			May 1-31, 1997     May 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   150,185	   170,372	    -11.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 206,087	   195,827	     +5.2</p>
<p> Import Car		 3,539	     4,609	    -23.2</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-May 31, 1997 Jan 1-May 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   658,992	   733,731	     -9.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 919,979	   886,670	     +4.6</p>
<p> Import Car		13,569	    21,092	    -35.2</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 128 for year to date vs 129 in year ago.</p>
</text>
